      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 784,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "🔹 AI Company Data Enrichment Workflow\n\nThis workflow automatically enriches company data using website URLs.\n\n📥 Input:\n- Google Sheet with company website URLs\n\n⚙️ Process:\n- Fetch pending records\n- Visit each website\n- Extract structured company data using AI\n- Merge and update results back into the sheet\n\n📤 Output:\n- Enriched company details stored in the same Google Sheet\n\n🤖 AI Provider:\n- TinyFish AI\n\n⏱ Execution:\n- Processes 5 companies per run (configurable)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0c126dc3-a20e-4a54-905b-d5578d58c5b5",
