      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 784,
        "height": 416,
        "content": "⚙️ Setup Required Before Running\n\nMake sure the following are configured:\n\n1. Google Sheets credentials\n2. TinyFish API credentials\n3. Google Sheet ID & Sheet Name\n\n📌 Required Columns:\n- Website URL\n- Status\n\nℹ️ Notes:\n- Only rows with empty \"Status\" will be processed\n- Other columns will be filled automatically"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
