        "content": "This step visits each company website and uses AI to extract structured business information.\n\n📊 Extracted Data:\n- Company Name\n- Email\n- Phone\n- LinkedIn\n- Founder / CEO\n- Industry\n- Address\n\n⚠️ Notes:\n- Only publicly available data is extracted\n- Missing values remain empty\n- Accuracy depends on website content\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
